aero — a modern rewrite of XFOIL in Rust

This project contains Rust ports of algorithms from XFOIL 6.996
(https://web.mit.edu/drela/Public/web/xfoil/), in particular:

  - spline.f   (SPLIND, SEGSPL, SEVAL, DEVAL, D2VAL, CURV, SINVRT, SCALC, TRISOL)
  - naca.f     (NACA4, NACA5)
  - xgeom.f    (LEFIND, NORM, SOPPS, TCCALC, GEOPAR)
  - xfoil.f    (PANGEN, TECALC, CPCALC, CLCALC, COMSET)
  - xpanel.f   (APCALC, NCALC, PSILIN, GGCALC, QISET)
  - xutils.f   (ATANC)

